          "name": "Create an ACH destination",
          "request": {
            "name": "Create an ACH destination",
            "description": {
              "content": "Create a set of ACH details that can be used as a destination for ACH Payments.\n\nAll monetary values are represented in minor units, or the smallest unit of the currency with no decimal (e.g., cents). For example, $10.00 is represented as 1000.\n\n\n\n<i>How can we improve these docs?             <a href=\"mailto:docs+feedback@narmi.com\">Share your feedback.</a></i>",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
